  m_Text: "<color=#E8C77A>Yap\u0131m, tasar\u0131m ve geli\u015Ftirme</color>  OZT Digital\n<color=#E8C77A>Motor</color>  Unity \xB7 Photon Fusion & Voice\n\n<color=#E8C77A>Modeller (CC-BY 4.0, Sketchfab)</color>\nBird_Amphora \u2013 GetDeadEntertainment \xB7 Armillary sphere \u2013 KRei \xB7 old church bell \u2013 vertexgrocer\nEngel Statue Scan \u2013 Refref1990 \xB7 Medieval Chandelier \u2013 Kevin.Popescu\n\n<color=#E8C77A>Doku, model ve g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFC (CC0)</color>  Poly Haven (polyhaven.com) \xB7 ambientCG (ambientcg.com)\n<color=#E8C77A>M\xFCzik (CC0, OpenGameArt)</color>  Cathedral in the forest \xB7 Abandoned Castle \u2013 StarNinjas \xB7 Castle Cellar \u2013 Bobjt\n<color=#E8C77A>Yaz\u0131 tipleri (SIL OFL 1.1)</color>  Cinzel, Cinzel Decorative, Spectral\n\nOynad\u0131\u011F\u0131n i\xE7in te\u015Fekk\xFCrler."
